people get depressed, and some have it harder than others. I went through a really bad stage in my life as well, and was even hospitalized for it. And I did have it really bad, but literally nothing anyone in there said or did changed my mind about my depression. and i can GUARANTEE no one in there will do it for you. Only you can change your mind about how you feel; and I can give you a good start:
